# Project Variables - MediAssist AI

This file lists the variables used across the project, categorized by type and location.

## Environment Variables (.env)
- GEMINI_API_KEY
- DATABASE_URL
- TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID
- TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN
- TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER

## Configuration Variables (backend/app/core/config.py)
- TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID
- TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN
- TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER
- GEMINI_API_KEY
- DATABASE_URL
- PROJECT_NAME
- API_V1_STR

## Backend Variables (by file)

### backend/main.py
- app (FastAPI instance)

### backend/app/services/voice_service.py
- _clean_text_for_speech: text
- make_automated_call: phone_number, script, voice, audio_base64, clean_script, communicate, audio_buffer, audio_bytes, status_msg

### backend/app/services/ai_summarization.py
- generate_patient_summary: extracted_data, prompt, models_to_try, model_name, model, response
- _generate_mental_health_fallback: data, summary, good, risks, reference_ranges, k, v, clean_name, val, ref

### backend/app/services/report_processing.py
- extract_medical_values_from_pdf: pdf_bytes, text, doc, page, markers, extracted_data, label, patterns, pattern, regex, match

### backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/calls.py
- handle_voice_webhook: From, Digits, twiml_response

### backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/reports.py
- upload_and_process_report: patient_id, patient_phone_number, file, file_content, extracted_data, summary, prescription_notes, full_script, call_result

